arbeitnow:software-development-engineer-:
&lt;h3&gt;Rejoins l’aventure Signeasy chez Decathlon Digital !&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du domaine Instore, responsable des outils utilisés dans nos magasins, l’équipe Signeasy développe et maintient les solutions liées au balisage (papier, électronique).&lt;br&gt;La bonne lisibilité de notre offre dans nos rayons étant un aspect stratégique de l’entreprise, l’équipe doit constamment fournir des solutions adaptées aux besoins business tout en assurant une haute disponibilité de celles-ci.&lt;br&gt;Dans le but de renforcer l’équipe, nous recrutons un-e &lt;strong&gt;Software Development Engineer Senior&lt;/strong&gt; basé-e à Nantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu'ingénieur logiciel senior, tu apportes ton expertise technique, ta rigueur d'ingénierie et ton pragmatisme au cœur de l'équipe opérationnelle pour concevoir des solutions robustes et évolutives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conception, Développement &amp;amp; Qualité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et développer (hands-on) des fonctionnalités complexes et à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être garant-e de la qualité de code, de la maintenabilité et du respect des bonnes pratiques (Clean Code, TDD, BDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire les besoins Produit en pré-analyses et spécifications techniques claires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réduire et gérer la dette technique de manière proactive par un refactoring continu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production, Performance &amp;amp; Observabilité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la haute disponibilité et la résilience de l'application en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et implémenter le monitoring et l'observabilité du périmètre (logs, métriques, traces) pour anticiper et résoudre rapidement les incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser les performances de nos outils et de nos flux de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Partage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer et participer activement aux revues de code (Code Reviews) pour diffuser les standards de l'équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner et mentorer les développeurs plus juniors dans leur montée en compétences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer les nouveaux usages (notamment l'assistance par IA) pour optimiser notre delivery et nos pratiques de test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Back-end :&lt;/strong&gt; Java 25, SpringBoot 4, Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-end :&lt;/strong&gt; Vue.js, JavaScript/TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Données &amp;amp; Flux :&lt;/strong&gt; PostgreSQL, Valkey, Kafka, RabbitMQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps :&lt;/strong&gt; GCP, Azure, Github Actions, Keda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualité logicielle :&lt;/strong&gt; Cucumber/Gherkin, Gatling, Playwright JS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observabilité :&lt;/strong&gt; OTEL, Datadog, Kibana, Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Méthodologie &amp;amp; outils :&lt;/strong&gt; Scrumban, GitHub, IntelliJ, VSCode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principes de développement :&lt;/strong&gt; TDD, BDD, Testcontainers, Archi Hexa, Event Driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà une expérience significative (+5 ans) sur un rôle similaire de développeur/se senior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises les architectures modernes (Event Driven, Architecture Hexagonale) et les bonnes pratiques de développement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un bon niveau d’anglais (B2/C1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux-se, force de proposition et à l'affût des innovations techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ton pragmatisme assure l’équilibre entre l'excellence technique et la vitesse de livraison.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ton esprit d'équipe et ton sens du collectif te permettent de partager facilement ton savoir-faire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine (jours libres).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liberté de choix de l'outil de travail (Mac, Windows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Équipe projet en local et partage avec le réseau mondial (parcours international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Montée en compétences et mentorat (diversité de projets, langages et technologies, certification, events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations internes et externes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actionnariat salarié.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles et trimestrielles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d'offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C'est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l'environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:forward-deployed-engineer-berl:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ427R35&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers' successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer's needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://x.com/databricks"&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks"&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer's discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:engineering-manager-sport-proc:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L'équipe Worldwide Offer recrute son/sa futur·e Engineering Manager à Lille !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au coeur de la unit Digital Sport, en relation directe avec les différentes marques de sport de Decathlon (Kipsta, Domyos, Quechua, ...) et le CoE Offer, le Domaine Sport Process met en place des produits et méthodes qui permettent à chaque responsable utilisateur, chaque pays, chaque équipe, d’identifier, choisir, créer, co-développer les meilleurs produits pour nos sportifs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de cet écosystème, l’équipe Worldwide Offer permet aux Sports d’imaginer les meilleures offres de produits sportifs et services possibles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De la connaissance du marché guidant la définition de l'architecture des sports au référencement et au pilotage de l'Offre Worldwide, nos solutions digitales sont le véritable moteur de l'innovation produit chez Decathlon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;AIDE LE·A CANDIDAT·E À SE PROJETER DANS L’ENVIRONNEMENT DECATHLON&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras responsable d’animer hiérarchiquement 3 feature teams, totalisant 12 Software Engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu collaboreras étroitement avec les métiers du Produit, de la Data &amp;amp; IA et du Design pour arbitrer entre enjeux business et faisabilité technique.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton rôle : faire grandir les collaborateurs, construire le plan humain de l’équipe, piloter le delivery des roadmaps 2027, assurer la qualité de données d'un système mondial et apporter de nouvelles solutions digitales qui transformeront le quotidien des sports : connaissance marché, catalogue d’offre, définition de l’usage des produits, plateforme de co-création.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras le garant de la cohérence des choix techniques avec la stratégie Offer Worldwide de Decathlon tout en optimisant la performance et la collaboration de ton équipe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frameworks (full stack) :&lt;/strong&gt; Java Spring Boot, NodeJS, PHP Symfony, ReactJS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture :&lt;/strong&gt; Event-Driven (Kafka, Kafka Streams, pattern Outbox).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Ops :&lt;/strong&gt; Kubernetes, Postgres, Helm, Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Data :&lt;/strong&gt; Cypress, Amplitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu disposes d'un socle solide en ingénierie logicielle et tu as déjà une expérience dans le leadership technique et humain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expert·e en gestion du delivery, tu sais créer des roadmaps et influencer tes parties prenantes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu excelles dans l'accompagnement des parcours de carrière (coaching, feedback) et tu as une réelle sensibilité business pour aligner la technique sur les KPIs de croissance d'un produit global.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu as un sens du service fort, tu sais engager tes équipes et célébrer les victoires, tu possèdes des fortes soft skills pour permettre au collectif Digital Offer de performer!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bureaux à Lille (Decathlon Digital) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagnement dans le développement de tes compétences managériales et techniques ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel au choix (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d'offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C'est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l'environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:lead-data-engineer-london-2661:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho, London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working: 3 days in the office Tues - Thurs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To provide technical leadership and hands-on contribution within a data engineering team, designing, building, and optimizing robust data pipelines and infrastructure for a global sports betting and media business. This role is crucial in delivering high-quality data solutions that support LiveScore’s strategic goals and embody our commitment to being Fan Driven and a Champion of Sport. You will mentor junior engineers and ensure technical excellence in your domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LiveScore Group, we’re the proud home of three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming world: LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet. A fully owned and operated ecosystem that converges the two worlds of sports media and sports betting. We’re proud of the high ratings for our commitment to excellence and fueling fan’s passion for sport driving us to the top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just lead; we innovate. Our cutting-edge products and immersive experiences set the standard, but it’s our people who truly make the difference. Every day, our team embody our values: adaptability, teamwork, a fan-driven approach, and an ever-curious mindset that fuels our ambition. As we scale and continue to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive, we know we need the most talented people with diverse backgrounds, perspectives and skills. If you’re good at what you do, come and join us. The more inclusive we are, the more amazing experiences we can create for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that job descriptions can sometimes seem daunting, and you might not feel you tick every box. But, if you’re passionate about the role and have relevant experience, we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a primary technical point of contact and subject matter expert for specific data engineering projects or domains, guiding team members through complex technical challenges and promoting innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Data Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, test, and deploy highly scalable, reliable, and fault-tolerant data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes. This includes data ingestion from diverse sources, data transformation, and data loading into various data stores (e.g., data warehouses, data lakes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Data Architects to translate architectural blueprints and standards into concrete implementations, ensuring new data components align with the overall data strategy and infrastructure requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship and Skill Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively mentor and coach junior and mid-level data engineers, providing constructive feedback, sharing technical knowledge, and fostering their growth in coding, data modeling, and general data engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a significant hands-on role in coding, data modeling, infrastructure-as-code development, and platform configuration, leading by example and ensuring high-quality output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality and Performance Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Take direct responsibility for ensuring the quality, integrity, and performance of data assets within their assigned domain or projects, implementing monitoring, validation, and optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Efficiency and Cost Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and implement technical optimizations for data processing, storage, and infrastructure utilization to improve efficiency, reduce operational costs, and enhance system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Review and Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and participate in rigorous code reviews, advocating for and enforcing engineering best practices, coding standards, and architectural patterns to maintain high code quality and system stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose, troubleshoot, and provide effective solutions for highly complex data-related issues, incidents, and performance bottlenecks, often working under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate effectively with other engineering teams, product managers, data scientists, and business stakeholders to understand data requirements, integrate solutions, and provide technical insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Data Pipeline Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven, in-depth experience as a senior or lead data engineer with a strong portfolio of hands-on contributions to designing, building, and optimizing complex, large-scale data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Data Warehousing (EDW) and Data Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong practical experience with EDW concepts, principles, and implementation, specifically including the design and practical application of a single, integrated data model for analytical purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Data Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with cloud-native data services and infrastructure on at least one major cloud provider (e.g., AWS services like S3, Redshift, Glue, EMR; GCP services like BigQuery, Dataflow, Pub/Sub; Azure services like Data Lake, Synapse Analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Optimization Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to identify, propose, and implement technical solutions that lead to significant cost savings in data processing, storage, and infrastructure within a large-scale data environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert proficiency in software development methodologies (e.g., Agile, Scrum), version control (Git), CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and comprehensive understanding of software engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional coding skills in at least one relevant programming language (e.g., Python, Scala, Java, JavaScript, C/C++), with a focus on writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience with various database technologies including relational databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, MySQL), NoSQL databases (e.g., MongoDB, Cassandra), and analytical data warehouses (e.g., Snowflake, Redshift, BigQuery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture Principles:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of data architecture patterns (e.g., Data Mesh, Data Lakehouse, Lambda/Kappa architectures), distributed systems, and their practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience in developing and maintaining robust and auditable data solutions for regulatory reporting, particularly within the gaming or other highly regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in AI prompting alongside staying ahead of emerging AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural leader who can effectively guide, inspire, and technically mentor junior and mid-level engineers. Possesses the ability to break down complex problems, provide clear direction, and foster a learning environment, thereby enhancing team capabilities and promoting adherence to best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Agreements where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare Scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Gym Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Travel Card Loan &amp;amp; Ride to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virgin Family: Giving you access to exclusive Virgin offers and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thursday drinks in the office and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:lead-software-engineer-uk-neth:
&lt;p data-local-id="c72cb78accbb" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true" data-pm-slice="1 3 []"&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;Lead Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="9203abde8e4c" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;Reports to: Director of Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="00cf1dcafad5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;Department: Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="3eb2b3cabd8f" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="fac87f3088b1" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="d2fcf4f24bf0" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;PQShield is looking for a Lead Software Engineer to help lead a cryptographic software IP team. As a Lead Software Engineer, you will be responsible for overseeing the entire software development lifecycle, from design to testing, and ensuring the delivery of high-quality software solutions. This includes planning, organizing, and managing the software development, including setting timelines, allocating resources, and tracking progress. You will work across a variety of environments, solving complex problems and developing other engineers, while maintaining a strong focus on quality and best practices. You will support the hiring, training, and managing of a team of software engineers, fostering collaboration, and resolving conflicts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="2f02d251f599" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;span id="ddad4c96-18bd-4352-be80-d6bb3e55ea2e" data-mark-type="annotation" data-mark-annotation-type="inlineComment" data-id="ddad4c96-18bd-4352-be80-d6bb3e55ea2e" data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="annotation"&gt;Candidates should hold a degree in Electronic Engineering/Computer Science or equivalent experience, backed by at least 10 years in software design and/or verification. We are looking for a technical lead—or a senior engineer ready to step up into leadership—to guide our team. Knowledge of cryptographic engineering and side-channel attack resistance is a major bonus. You should be ready to contribute to cross-team strategy, lead architectural reviews, and drive planning for your team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="e1253695958c" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;span id="20e0d5a7-c8b2-476c-8a72-8438da12e0ce" data-mark-type="annotation" data-mark-annotation-type="inlineComment" data-id="20e0d5a7-c8b2-476c-8a72-8438da12e0ce" data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="annotation"&gt;Founded in 2018, we are a well-funded deep tech startup with proven technology and a clear path to market. Joining us now offers a unique opportunity to work directly with our founders and inventors, fast-track your career progression, and shape a rapidly expanding segment of the semiconductor industry (Post-Quantum Cryptography and RISC-V).&lt;/span&gt; This is a great opportunity&amp;nbsp; for career progression and to get a head start in a rapidly expanding segment of the semiconductor industry (Post-Quantum Cryptography and RISC-V).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="df4c222c6338" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id="24490093d3f7" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="4051e37fd161" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Working with other &lt;span id="43aa3e8e-802b-4816-a127-8abfa7ee5606" data-mark-type="annotation" data-mark-annotation-type="inlineComment" data-id="43aa3e8e-802b-4816-a127-8abfa7ee5606" data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="annotation"&gt;engineering leaders&lt;/span&gt; and project managers to plan and allocate work, ensuring we are delivering on our product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;You’ll be expected to take on a technical leadership role, and be responsible for coordinating and delivering application and embedded software IP design projects from conception to customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Line Management of a software engineering team:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Identifying hiring needs, conducting interviews, and selecting suitable candidates for open positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Orienting new colleagues, providing necessary training, and ensuring they have the tools and knowledge to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Setting clear expectations, providing regular feedback, conducting performance reviews, and recognising and rewarding achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Identifying training and development opportunities to help colleagues grow their skills and advance their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Addressing under-performance, providing coaching and support, and taking disciplinary action when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Fostering positive relationships with team members, resolving conflicts, and promoting a positive work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring the software engineering team has all of the tooling and infrastructure it needs to function well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Mentoring other colleagues, and being a point of contact for software design expertise within the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Working with verification engineers to review verification and test plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Define architectural definitions for complex algorithmic and/or system level solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Providing feedback to colleagues on feasibility of implementation and specification quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Working closely with other teams and project stakeholders, and acting as an enabler for their development work. E.g. coordinating with hardware engineers or our product vulnerability team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Engaging with customers, including helping with integration questions, or answering questions during technical sales calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="ed16aa5bc2f5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Ensuring clean lint and implementation reports for IP blocks and subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="b0fdf9945c0c" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="4b42e7e35ac1" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Confidence in planning out a project development cycle and coordinating with project managers as development progresses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="a443c1066507" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;A commitment to high quality engineering in all areas of their work, including advocating for the best long-term solutions over the easiest or quickest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="72dd13eb0629" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Self-starter with the ability to work with and inspire a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="e7fe5099f3a8" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Experience building software IP blocks from scratch, and owning the process from initial specification through to customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="86fcee610c73" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Expert level C experience in an embedded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="1f7f26b13b4c" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Able to apply knowledge effectively in unfamiliar situations and actively maintains own knowledge and shares with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="533b7ec4b5b4" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Rapidly absorbs and critically assesses new information and applies it effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="2276e74b92f0" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Specifies architectural solutions to technical challenges across multiple technical domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="7be1fb0bf4f6" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Understanding of cryptographic algorithms, protocols, and key management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;👍 Preferred Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="53b8a646ba1c" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Familiarity with PQC standards and protocols (e.g., NIST PQC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="b2e0b0848303" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Familiarity with Rust in an Embedded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="c77e2f9b6de8" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Previous experience with software/hardware co-designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="0a7f6aaa4622" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Arm &amp;amp; RISC-V experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="1626397dcecd" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Knowledge of side-channel security countermeasures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="497cec53f378" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Confidence using Gitlab CI, or otherwise principles of continuous integration and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="5be13d0a36e6" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Confidence with the Python programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="cc36332b58c5" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Previous experience managing a cross-functional software team successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type="mark" data-prosemirror-mark-name="strong"&gt;🏆 Some of the perks of working with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="3f93816393a9" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Unparalleled opportunities to learn and accelerated career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="b684e8a99d1a" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;A collaborative, team environment with people who truly love what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="4bfa362572e8" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Competitive salary and share option scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="f0688f19a07b" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Flexible and hybrid working, and a working from home budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="9d65f512f2ff" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;Private health insurance for yourself and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="1f32fc13e680" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;25 days annual leave (plus bank holidays and two wellness weeks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="19e78e1ab17d" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;50% gym membership discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id="6d14d961a72f" data-prosemirror-content-type="node" data-prosemirror-node-name="paragraph" data-prosemirror-node-block="true"&gt;The chance to work with a spirited, smart, and friendly team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type="italic"&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-software-engineer-prism:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="p" data-block="true" data-editor="65rta" data-offset-key="f5edm-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="f5edm-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="f5edm-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;The Prism team builds the systems that turn Elastic Security's raw data into a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id="popover-trigger-:ro:" class="chakra-text css-8zk7oi"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="f5edm-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;trustworthy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="f5edm-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; picture of the users, hosts, and services in a customer's environment. We power the Entity Store, entity risk scoring, entity resolution, and the data maintainers that analysts rely on to understand who did what, what's risky, and what to investigate next. We build features that have to work at scale, and we care deeply about correctness and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p" data-block="true" data-editor="65rta" data-offset-key="aibue-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="aibue-0-0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="aibue-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="aibue-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;As a senior engineer, you will lead technical work across this area. You'll partner with product, design, and engineering to turn hard, ambiguous problems into reliable, performant systems that ship to real security teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p" data-block="true" data-editor="65rta" data-offset-key="4njn2-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4njn2-0-0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4njn2-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4njn2-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;We're a distributed team — we work across time zones and collaborate in GitHub, Slack, design reviews, and code reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class="public-DraftStyleDefault-ul" data-offset-key="9nvpl-0-0"&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="65rta" data-offset-key="9nvpl-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="9nvpl-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="9nvpl-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Own small-to-medium projects from technical design through production, including data modeling, background tasks, and APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR" data-block="true" data-editor="65rta" data-offset-key="7n9b0-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="7n9b0-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="7n9b0-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Make our features fast and reliable at scale: profile and optimize queries, tame timeouts, and design for a range of customer topologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
